F. Lane details
  Q,< finite-chain maximum
    local maximum:       a finite embedded chain has a last element
    ambient embedding:   countable dense linear order without endpoints
    missing address:     which open cut / endpoint boundary the chain occupies
    destructive extension:insert a rational above the finite maximum or inside any gap
    derivative readout:  extension-count ledger over n+1 cuts
  Dedekind cut completion
    local maximum:       finite denominator search has a best lower approximation
    ambient embedding:   Q embedded in its completion R
    missing address:     cut address: lower set with no rational maximum
    destructive extension:raise the best approximation inside the same irrational cut
    derivative readout:  cut-improvement sequence / endpoint-loss sum
  LRC14 owner-private stability
    local maximum:       AP/Vstar/2AP are floor atoms in the visible Res_27 shell
    ambient embedding:   local +27 carry space over the same visible shell
    missing address:     paired owner-private deletion flag
    destructive extension:nonzero local carry preserving the visible shell
    derivative readout:  owner-deletion loss ledger; S666 mixed fibers drop to zero
  Endpoint protection core
    local maximum:       an all-protected endpoint set is a maximal obstruction core
    ambient embedding:   endpoint incidence graph inside the quotient denominator
    missing address:     protector owner for each endpoint
    destructive extension:peel an endpoint with no remaining private protector
    derivative readout:  core-peeling derivative / exposed endpoint sum
  Tournament endpoint private child
    local maximum:       private endpoint child is a pivot-maximal witness
    ambient embedding:   endpoint-extension matrix n -> n+1
    missing address:     parent owner row and child column address
    destructive extension:complement merging creates non-private SC collision columns
    derivative readout:  rank/private-pivot deletion ledger
  Graph reconstruction rooted deck
    local maximum:       deck-derived scalar/subgraph counts look maximal
    ambient embedding:   graph embedded in its rooted/deleted-card deck
    missing address:     deleted vertex / card-to-boundary address
    destructive extension:unrooted deck collision with different rooted assignment
    derivative readout:  rooted Kelly/Kocay constraint sums
  Unit-distance frontier owner
    local maximum:       edge/direction support can be extremal in a fixed point set
    ambient embedding:   point set embedded in extension/deletion frontier
    missing address:     ear/frontier owner and unit-spine endpoint address
    destructive extension:add/delete a point while preserving coarse direction support
    derivative readout:  frontier edge-loss and spine-loss sums
  A000568 marked observer fiber
    local maximum:       unmarked isomorphism class is maximal as a quotient object
    ambient embedding:   class embedded in rooted/observer perspectives
    missing address:     observer root and endpoint threshold address
    destructive extension:change root while preserving unmarked class
    derivative readout:  observer-source deletion sums
  Rado/Fraisse extension property
    local maximum:       finite pattern is maximal inside its induced substructure
    ambient embedding:   universal homogeneous limit
    missing address:     one-point extension type
    destructive extension:realize every compatible extension type
    derivative readout:  extension-type count / age derivative
  Matroid basis activity
    local maximum:       a basis is maximal independent inside the matroid
    ambient embedding:   basis embedded in an ordered matroid / activity expansion
    missing address:     edge/order activity address
    destructive extension:exchange an active element without changing coarse rank
    derivative readout:  deletion-contraction activity sum
  Forcing model maximality
    local maximum:       a cardinal or truth value is maximal inside one model
    ambient embedding:   model embedded in forcing/generic extension
    missing address:     generic filter / forcing-name address
    destructive extension:force an extension where the scalar statement changes
    derivative readout:  truth-value ledger over model boundary

