H. Synthesis
  Embedded maximality turns 'maximal' into a boundary-sensitive predicate.
  Q,< says finite maxima are real inside a finite image but unstable in the
  dense ambient order; Dedekind completion names the missing cut address.
  For LRC14, S666 suggests the analogous ambient is the owner-deletion
  ledger: visible Res_27 maxima remain stable only when their private-owner
  addresses survive every allowed carry extension.
